# Icon sets are pure derivatives of apps/sync/src-tauri/icons/app-icon.png and
# are regenerated by `pnpm icons` (wired into every ios:*/android:* script).
# BOTH `tauri ios init` and `tauri android init` seed their icon slots with
# Tauri's own placeholder logo; the iOS set was committed that way once, which
# is exactly the drift keeping generated bytes out of git prevents.
src-tauri/icons
src-tauri/gen/apple/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/*.png
src-tauri/gen/android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-*/*.png
